    "detailed_description": "FireAlpaca SE is the exclusive paint software to Windows / Mac operating system that is widely suitable for beginners to advanced users.<br>We removed all the advertisements from FireAlpaca freeware version, that enables the faster performance and more stable environment.  <br><br><strong>The special features that only FireAlpaca SE has are:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Switchable 2 interface colors (Dark/Right)<br></li><li>Liquify tool <br></li><li>Layer Mask <br></li><li>Special Brushes (Available for download from the brush store)<br></li><li>No advertisement<br></li><li>Only buy outright<br></li><li>No subscription<br></li><li>Automatic update to an improved version</li></ul>More unique features will be implemented to FireAlpaca SE for the future development.<br><br><strong>The distinctive features of FireAlpaca are:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Timelapse*<br></li><li>Brush script function (programmable brush processing)<br></li><li>1 bit / 8 bit layer (can reduce memory consumption)<br></li><li>Onion skin function (allows to create simple animations)<br></li><li>Materials window (work can be done while displaying materials)<br></li><li>Snap function (easy to draw parallel lines, curves, ellipses, saturated lines, etc.)<br></li><li>Smooth brush processing compatible with Wintab tablets</li></ul>*Below is a timelapse image. <br>You can follow the trajectory of your creation.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/458750/extras/3130abceb7c395149c3e4b7fd4e10e4c.poster.avif?t=1751861653\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/458750/extras/3130abceb7c395149c3e4b7fd4e10e4c.webm?t=1751861653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/458750/extras/3130abceb7c395149c3e4b7fd4e10e4c.mp4?t=1751861653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Rich features include:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Layer function (18 kinds of blend modes, clipping, layer folder)<br></li><li>Selection function (rectangle, lasso, selection pen, etc.)<br></li><li>Transformation and free transformation of the selection area (choose 3 types of image quality)<br></li><li>Brush processing such as watercolor, scatter watercolor, bitmap, pattern, etc.<br></li><li>Re-editable text function<br></li><li>Filters such as level correction, hue, Gaussian blur, and cloud patterns</li></ul>",
